# Compliance Confirmation

## ✅ Workflow Compliance

- [ ] **PLAN** phase completed with supervisor approval
- [ ] **EXECUTE** phase completed within approved scope
- [ ] **VERIFY** phase completed with validation
- [ ] **REPORT** phase completed with documentation

## 🎯 Paradigms Applied

**Core Paradigms**:

- [ ] **YAGNI** - No premature features added
- [ ] **OBSERVABLE** - Work emits evidence (logs, tests, documentation)
- [ ] **EXPLICIT** - Clear and documented behavior
- [ ] **IDEMPOTENT** - Safe to run multiple times
- [ ] **DETERMINISTIC** - Predictable outputs
- [ ] **RELIABLE** - Proper error handling
- [ ] **MINIMAL** - Smallest viable change
- [ ] **COMPLETE** - Code + tests + docs + validation
- [ ] **REVERSIBLE** - Changes can be rolled back
- [ ] **COMPOSABLE** - Changes work with existing code
- [ ] **TRACEABLE** - All changes linked to plan/issue
- [ ] **TEST-DRIVEN** - Tests capture intent
- [ ] **EVIDENCE-DRIVEN** - Decisions based on data

**Additional Principles**:

- [ ] **SECURE** - Sensitive data handled appropriately
- [ ] **MAINTAINABLE** - Code is readable and modifiable
- [ ] **SCALABLE** - Solution handles growth

## 📝 Communication Standards

- [ ] **When unsure** - Asked for clarification when needed
- [ ] **Escalation** - Reported blockers early with context
- [ ] **Change requests** - Updated plan before implementing changes
- [ ] **Status updates** - Provided regular, concise updates
- [ ] **Documentation** - Documented all decisions and rationale
- [ ] **Feedback** - Provided constructive feedback

## 🔍 Quality Standards

- [ ] **Documentation** - All public APIs have docstrings
- [ ] **Type Hints** - Used for all function parameters and return values
- [ ] **Error Handling** - Proper exception handling with meaningful messages
- [ ] **Logging** - Structured logging with appropriate levels
- [ ] **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, secure coding practices
- [ ] **Test Coverage** - High test coverage maintained
- [ ] **Code Review** - All changes reviewed and approved

## 🧹 Cleanup Verification

- [ ] **Atomic Changes** - All or nothing changes applied
- [ ] **No Orphans** - No leftover files or directories
- [ ] **CHANGELOG.md** - Updated with all changes
- [ ] **Rollback Ready** - Changes can be reverted quickly

